{"1298430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warsong", "steam_appid": 1298430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warsong</strong> is a fantastic <strong>RTS</strong> with RPG features such as Hero and equipement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 factions—<strong>Humans</strong>, <strong>Horde</strong>, and <strong>Undead</strong>—each with 3 unique heroes and shared units. Every hero and unit has its own skill tree. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Equipement System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In both RTS and RPG modes, heroes can loot equipment from control points or bosses on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in an RPG, equipment has different stats and can be kept between games. Gear comes in different quality levels, from Normal to Mystic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic map mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On RTS skirmish maps, there are lots of interesting points to explore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By taking control of guarded points, heroes can earn experience and loot valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At mercenary camps and the Grand Arena, players can hire powerful neutral units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other interesting locationsare also worth visiting, such as the Fountain of Life or neutral villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AI Assistant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can activate the <strong>AI assistant</strong> to help them <strong>construct bases</strong>, <strong>train units</strong>, and even <strong>control units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI assistant can be configured to perform certain tasks, and players can even control just the hero, as in RPG games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features in developement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access ends on <strong>2026.07.05</strong>, bringing exciting new features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Mode (Available in 2026.03.15)</strong><br>Pick one hero and two captains to explore dungeon maps, defeat enemies and bosses, and loot powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Faction</strong><br>A 4th faction joins the battle, featuring 3 unique heroes and shared units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Maps</strong><br>Enjoy new RTS and RPG maps for even more battles and adventures.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warsong</strong> is a fantastic <strong>RTS</strong> with RPG features such as Hero and equipement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 factions—<strong>Humans</strong>, <strong>Horde</strong>, and <strong>Undead</strong>—each with 3 unique heroes and shared units. Every hero and unit has its own skill tree. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Equipement System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In both RTS and RPG modes, heroes can loot equipment from control points or bosses on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in an RPG, equipment has different stats and can be kept between games. Gear comes in different quality levels, from Normal to Mystic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic map mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On RTS skirmish maps, there are lots of interesting points to explore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By taking control of guarded points, heroes can earn experience and loot valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At mercenary camps and the Grand Arena, players can hire powerful neutral units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other interesting locationsare also worth visiting, such as the Fountain of Life or neutral villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AI Assistant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can activate the <strong>AI assistant</strong> to help them <strong>construct bases</strong>, <strong>train units</strong>, and even <strong>control units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI assistant can be configured to perform certain tasks, and players can even control just the hero, as in RPG games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.poster.avif?t=1782518907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.webm?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.mp4?t=1782518907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features in developement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access ends on <strong>2026.07.05</strong>, bringing exciting new features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Mode (Available in 2026.03.15)</strong><br>Pick one hero and two captains to explore dungeon maps, defeat enemies and bosses, and loot powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Faction</strong><br>A 4th faction joins the battle, featuring 3 unique heroes and shared units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Maps</strong><br>Enjoy new RTS and RPG maps for even more battles and adventures.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Warsong is a fantasy RTS with RPG elements. Choose from Humans, Horde, or Undead, each featuring three heroes and three specialization paths. Heroes gain random card upgrades as they level up and permanently retain their equipment across battles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian, Dutch, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/10d505f87b5ec7adfce47c043595a6c59cbf42fc/header.jpg?t=1782518907", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/388a08454310315aca6df12ea8c7b64e193cefbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782518907", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/388a08454310315aca6df12ea8c7b64e193cefbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782518907", "website": "https://x.c